{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-aba89573cac65d84b46b","title":"高堂隆谏西取长安大钟及宫殿劳费","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-aba89573cac65d84b46b","label":"正文","text":"高堂隆谏西取长安大钟及宫殿劳费","evidence":["xinyang-q-6cd627d09aa3122296fa"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0041","role":"上疏","evidence":["xinyang-q-6cd627d09aa3122296fa"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-6cd627d09aa3122296fa"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-6cd627d09aa3122296fa","order":5101}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0041","name":"高堂隆","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-6cd627d09aa3122296fa","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-0fca4959fe8b7369d00f","layer":"original","quote":"青龙中，大治殿舍，西取长安大钟〖1〗。隆上疏曰：“昔周景王不仪刑文、武之明德〖2〗，忽公旦之圣制〖3〗；既铸大钱，又作大钟；单穆公谏而弗听〖4〗，伶州鸠对而弗从〖5〗；遂迷不反，周德以衰。良史记焉，以为永鉴。然今之小人，好说秦、汉之奢靡以荡圣心，求取亡国不度之器〖6〗，劳役费损，以伤德政；非所以兴礼乐之和，保神明之休也〖7〗。”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":165}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
